Silas is the guide at the office of the [[Org/Friends of Aut|Friends of Aut]] at 13 Bright Street in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Aurideon/index|Aurideon]]. He is a Major-Chaplain of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]], and one of [[Aut]]'s friends among the Church's higher ranks. He leads guests up to the threshold room of the [[Pharos]], hands them the week-old report on conditions past the black doorway, and tells them the rules of that place.
